{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本抗癌網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）因長年公開乳癌治療歷程並鼓舞病友而廣受關注。她26歲時確診乳癌零期，從此展開漫長抗癌之路，沒想到今年10月再度被醫師宣告生命僅剩1個月，近日傳出她不敵病魔離世，享年41歲，母親透過YouTube頻道證實噩耗，悲傷透露女兒最後握著自己的手，安詳地離開了。</p><p>26歲確診零期乳癌　34歲遭判剩2個月</p><p>Mimipopo在26歲從事服飾銷售工作時，某天刮除胸前細毛，意外摸到右胸內側有硬塊，就醫檢查後確診乳癌零期。當時她選擇不接受外科手術，而是嘗試不同治療方式，但隨著年齡增長，腫瘤逐漸惡化，甚至發展成「潰瘍型乳癌」（花咲き乳がん），腫瘤最大達6乘11公分。34歲時，她再度面臨沉重打擊，醫師告知生命可能只剩下2個月。</p><figure><img alt=\"日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）抗癌15年病逝。（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199395294895149056768153.jpeg/boEe66wRDw4YGnKYv4b8w4pp_2BOn6Max7Me58ezHuc\"/><figcaption>日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）抗癌15年病逝。（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）</figcaption></figure><p>更多「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）照片：</p><figure><img alt=\"日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）26歲時確診乳癌，從此展開漫長抗癌之路。（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199396223367254016302197.jpeg/hnRX3eIeZsVg7NcGP9lB7qMIR8-QJhEXfQJVD30CVQ8\"/><figcaption>日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）26歲時確診乳癌，從此展開漫長抗癌之路。（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）34歲時被醫生告知生命可能只剩下2個月。（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199396226622164992753148.jpeg/fq_41GMtXAmlMSFEwxG6GkRxq-_xy6A9L7uz2y-7s9s\"/><figcaption>日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）34歲時被醫生告知生命可能只剩下2個月。（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）今年10月再度被醫生宣告生命僅剩1個月，近日傳出她不敵病魔離世，享年41歲。（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199396228824305664197068.jpeg/TsoWVWdIKSh4TvXiuWa9sstxZ-fBH4DQBUD7vwVA-78\"/><figcaption>日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）今年10月再度被醫生宣告生命僅剩1個月，近日傳出她不敵病魔離世，享年41歲。（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199396231227772928528314.jpeg/4L6d_lPNLnl6sVqsjwoinH-pbVCOeX9DC7m1awu5tWs\"/><figcaption>日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199396233484439552493218.jpeg/stouYPs9dEka419CH4dEftDzEHgw7QbiZjakz2Y2pM8\"/><figcaption>日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199396223367254016708362.jpeg/t6AU3jkdn8EYAIz-3LkyyJmKAFWxuypHQIcDtECHA7Q\"/><figcaption>日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199396225946882048603249.jpeg/bPuMqZgVN4YadiyIg0mJGMSqz9fO73wkKVvkSClb5Eg\"/><figcaption>日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199396228329377792371092.jpeg/9AIsZCIYYZgJy5yrn6Dgo9fc5eIfI09p9Zm7bfWZu20\"/><figcaption>日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199396231512985600584379.jpeg/v8JhL_mgmfoepeNy2mOfMa9lzobuh5dTg8hnYYPIZ2E\"/><figcaption>日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199396233488633856670841.jpeg/5uUnUkG5_l6FQoX8H3075cOfK7xWOnBKHmPmtB5j5rQ\"/><figcaption>日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199396202613837824714968.jpeg/zmoAEh1syL76xQwo4fwgH8lzWo_IjCt9Ov2LLzr9iy8\"/><figcaption>日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261117/1199396204958584832605891.jpeg/Nx0oOBvHSAScWHJIOntib4IamIb6xMFBKiiI3yooiN8\"/><figcaption>日本網紅「ミミポポ」（Mimipopo）（YouTube@CH-mimipopo）</figcaption></figure><p>回憶起當時得知病情的心情，Mimipopo曾坦言，自己並沒有感到害怕，反而是母親當場落淚。她也不避諱談起過去治療選擇帶來的遺憾，坦承曾經後悔，但也直言，那是當時的自己所能做出的最好決定。</p><p>也因為走過這段艱辛歷程，Mimipopo決定透過網路分享自己的抗癌經驗，不希望其他患者和自己一樣後悔。她長年透過部落格及YouTube記錄治療過程、病情變化與生活點滴，即使面對一次次考驗，仍選擇坦然分享，讓更多人看見癌症患者真實的一面。</p><p>10月病情惡化被告知剩1個月　母親悲痛證實死訊</p><p>多年來，她累積約3000篇部落格文章及超過240部影片，陪伴許多病友走過低潮。今年10月再度被告知生命只剩1個月，她仍持續向外界傳遞感謝與希望。如今，Mimipopo母親證實其死訊，不少粉絲與支持者也紛紛留言表達不捨。</p><figure><img alt=\"延伸閱讀：《超人狄奧》中田乃愛逝世得年23歲　遺作下月上映最後帖文惹惋惜（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000708440133632029451.jpeg/Ma2-XUClGfKfViQLzz4T-GWg2EyRfQ2aL_a3yS_2t8k\"/><figcaption>延伸閱讀：《超人狄奧》中田乃愛逝世得年23歲　遺作下月上映最後帖文惹惋惜（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日本女星中田乃愛驚傳離世，得年23歲。她的外型甜美可愛，在觀眾心中好感度極高。（《超人狄奧》劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1198999008484265984978051.jpeg/cO0Xg0eM1bqW4i3mtKK4rZXyUZ-yMJULOLPMHDizzBw\"/><figcaption>日本女星中田乃愛驚傳離世，得年23歲。她的外型甜美可愛，在觀眾心中好感度極高。（《超人狄奧》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000703582867456869043.jpeg/WAP8Wzu4BZCdd1R0KeGE8B3K43ObGGSqJCJ2WCQidlg\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000706053443584195832.jpeg/LbGX2KJpGOvulA54HoB7_CfMIg2aSL75ZcEdbWXBHW0\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000710965235712821357.jpeg/iqYD_98D9bjntq28pp7OCkbdkkCtiAvbvY_QOb2P0Dk\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000713054130176796024.jpeg/R4u1mRWQw_9pkVdcrl5-ay2sEr_mfqLH-oSVV_qElVc\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000702299410432659043.jpeg/OwK8wNokOBEDkzrzpJpOroxlDXPkmEZXGs_prhrP6a4\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000704698683392095164.jpeg/v3U16o95iHJB5Wq4CGEin3v71_-54ZBYw1C-1MNQvtQ\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000707022458880407286.jpeg/c_88MBB8wll08Bx96hxisw0m4EqbziOY8_AvxfPwL8U\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000709228793856564732.jpeg/ODaQd0qIUezUq9rKK0TN2DSP0hzeYb5IUeIdylHiHco\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000711464488960251463.jpeg/1h-d7rwszgsfc1FjUJkjnfPkCeOF6giibuO3aW7jt2k\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261116/1199000698914607104745923.jpeg/g0KABoWQUddTZyygNtiscAr1YaXtGrp69OomyPTqJsg\"/><figcaption>中田乃愛（Instagram@noanakada0621）</figcaption></figure><p>父親病逝、母親失智！女星憂鬱症纏身近況曝光　崩潰3隻狗陪伴</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:51:17.992105+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1789,"images":25,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:40:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T08:44:32.860539+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:44:32.860539+00:00","content_hash":"b7545e2bea686ab91af7d26ecb7d3d34b